<title>RUSSIA: Rouble fixed at 3,319 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble fixed at 3,319 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble was set at 3,319 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange on Monday.</p>
<p>				    Apr 28		  Apr 25</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,319		   3,347</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
